---
import { FOOTER_LINKS, LINKS, SITE } from '../data/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="band-ink mt-0">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-5 py-14 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_2fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5" aria-label="回到首页">
          <img src="/images/logo.webp" alt="" width="30" height="30" class="size-[30px]" />
          <span class="text-base font-extrabold tracking-tight">Taste Skill</span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[38ch] text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed opacity-70">
          {SITE.tagline}。一组可移植的 Agent 技能，让编码 Agent 做出被设计过的界面，而不是平均值的界面。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5">
          <a
            href={LINKS.upstreamRepo}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold underline decoration-[1.5px] underline-offset-4"
          >
            github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6">
          <a href={LINKS.starHistory} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img
              src="https://api.star-history.com/badge?repo=Leonxlnx/taste-skill&theme=dark"
              alt="Star History 排名"
              width="420"
              height="120"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {
          FOOTER_LINKS.map((group) => (
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-[0.8125rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] opacity-55">
                {group.group}
              </h2>
              <ul class="mt-3.5 list-none space-y-2 p-0">
                {group.items.map((item) => (
                  <li>
                    <a
                      href={item.href}
                      target={item.external ? '_blank' : undefined}
                      rel={item.external ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
                      class="text-[0.92rem] opacity-80 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4"
                    >
                      {item.label}
                    </a>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-t border-white/15 pt-6">
      <p class="max-w-[76ch] text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed opacity-60">
        <strong class="font-semibold opacity-100">免责声明</strong> &mdash; Taste Skill 没有官方发行的代币、硬币或加密项目。任何使用作者姓名、形象或本项目名义的代币都与作者无关，也未获得认可。
      </p>
      <div
        class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[0.8125rem] opacity-60"
      >
        <span>MIT License · Copyright (c) 2026 Leonxlnx</span>
        <span>
          <a
            href={LINKS.cnRepo}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="hover:opacity-100 hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4">本站源码</a
          >
          · © {year} · 本站内容译自上游 README 与 CHANGELOG
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
